# Title: Suspicious Download From Direct IP Via Bitsadmin
# ID: 99c840f2-2012-46fd-9141-c761987550ef
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-06-28
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1197, attack.s0190, attack.t1036.003
# Description: Detects usage of bitsadmin downloading a file using an URL that contains an IP
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((cmdline:*://1* OR cmdline:*://2* OR cmdline:*://3* OR cmdline:*://4* OR cmdline:*://5* OR cmdline:*://6* OR cmdline:*://7* OR cmdline:*://8* OR cmdline:*://9*)) AND ((cmdline:* /transfer * OR cmdline:* /create * OR cmdline:* /addfile *)) AND ((process_name:*\\bitsadmin.exe) OR (OriginalFileName:"bitsadmin.exe"))) AND -((cmdline:*://7-*)))
